  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Kibewep.gif\" alt=\"Logo\"><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">為終界之眼與終界傳送門框架添加隨機的動畫眨眼效果。同時也為海洋之心添加了眨眼特效！</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>支援版本</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">1.13.x - 1.20.x</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">1.12.x（注意：最新檔案無法使用，請下載 EnderEyes_backport.zip 以獲得 1.12 支援）</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>模組支援</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/endremastered\" rel=\"nofollow\">End Remastered</a>：為所有終界之眼變體添加眨眼效果，並提供精美的紋理重製！</span></li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fI3I410P9Q1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"border:0px\" src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/kofi2.png?v=3\" alt=\"在 ko-fi.com 請我喝杯咖啡\" width=\"196\" height=\"50\"></a></p><p><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4UV0z4K.png\" alt=\"圖片\" width=\"1040\" height=\"320\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/o2D3D2f.gif\" alt=\"動態圖片！嗚嗚嗚\" width=\"2356\" height=\"1315\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/THwvk3p.png\" alt=\"物品紋理眨眼循環\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VtxZw0x.gif\" alt=\"End Remastered 與海洋之心\" width=\"1436\" height=\"807\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iw1MIpK.png\" alt=\"圖片\" width=\"1040\" height=\"320\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/blinking-ender-eyes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZniwvvZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"63\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/baby-animals-remastered\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/B2eR3FW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mob-crates\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MrkE2a3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/default-style-halloween-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PwGFKBm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/default-style-fall-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BehR5p7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/new-default-style-christmas-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HTdgpYI.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/default-style-winter-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sU8jEWl.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mushrooms-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/I44ugv6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/villager-ravager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vVFn56b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a></p><p>模組紋理重製：</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/grappling-hook-mod-3d-retexture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bEDnkof.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/grappling-hook-mod-retexture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gqxSiwm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/smooth-drawers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7k0IzpZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"315\"></a></p>",
